      "chapter_id": "windmill",
      "stage_index": 8,
      "level_index": 2,
      "level_id": "windmill-03",
      "text": "守卫恢复待机、风车稳定，小龙选择留下，三人滑翔抵达通往水乡的道路。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/clear_8.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "00f99abf98f167c04b8940b22a26307d427c29e8621aeeec22c7626a2866b2dc",
      "character_count": 33,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/2/levels/2/success"
      ]
    },
    "intro_3": {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "kind": "chapter_intro",
      "title": "第三章 · 月光下的真假回声",
      "chapter_index": 3,
      "chapter_id": "water",
      "stage_index": 9,
      "text": "水乡的水闸失灵，夜里总有奇怪的声音从河道传来，居民只好暂时关上渡口。三人发现，有些声音来自泡妖的恶作剧，真正的守灯人则被困在旧神殿。小馒头用回声铃辨认声音的方向，旺仔保护大家穿过水车回廊，小龙借风把伙伴送到安全落点。他们逐步排开积水、救出守灯人，最终在月光祭台净化水源晶，让水乡重新亮起莲灯。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/intro_3.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "f56a606d1d22646ce8fa24b3b1c3e4b92b15badd4af8197aea6873343b83f605",
      "character_count": 146,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 35.6,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/3/summary"
      ]
    },
    "clear_9": {
      "id": "clear_9",
      "kind": "stage_clear",
      "title": "渡口寻声",
      "chapter_index": 3,
      "chapter_id": "water",
      "stage_index": 9,
      "level_index": 0,
      "level_id": "water-01",
      "text": "确认真正的守灯人标记，排除恶作剧声源，水闸入口被标记。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/clear_9.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "227a2871fa9480754128b07e23499ddd8990caa236258fae17dec8406530ef49",
      "character_count": 27,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/3/levels/0/success"
      ]
    },
    "clear_10": {
      "id": "clear_10",
      "kind": "stage_clear",
      "title": "水车回廊",
      "chapter_index": 3,
      "chapter_id": "water",
      "stage_index": 10,
      "level_index": 1,
      "level_id": "water-02",
      "text": "主水位回到标记线，守灯人抵达安全点，祭台入口开放。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/clear_10.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "6aac1dd2b2c19689db53586119cc87c57833c5b008b601bd963b142f3cd133be",
      "character_count": 25,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/3/levels/1/success"
      ]
    },
    "clear_11": {
      "id": "clear_11",
      "kind": "stage_clear",
      "title": "月光祭台",
      "chapter_index": 3,
      "chapter_id": "water",
      "stage_index": 11,
      "level_index": 2,
      "level_id": "water-03",
      "text": "精英泡妖散去影雾，水源晶净化，水乡主灯与沿岸莲灯一起亮起。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/clear_11.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "0399a889e6ea2ea2f382c13c1c46e9168d91ae13a4586f60e3f3129a0a9ea027",
      "character_count": 29,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/3/levels/2/success"
      ]
    },
    "intro_4": {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "kind": "chapter_intro",
      "title": "第四章 · 父亲走过的路",
      "chapter_index": 4,
      "chapter_id": "ruins",
      "stage_index": 12,
      "text": "守灯人保存的星图指向一座被水与藤蔓围住的遗迹。借助此前学会的能力，三人进入古老长廊，发现老龙王年轻时与人类伙伴共同点灯的记录。小龙第一次知道，父亲也曾经迷路、受挫，需要别人帮助。遗迹深处的石甲守卫被吞灯妖篡改星纹，正保护着最后一颗源晶。三人修正星图、解除守卫的影雾，让遗迹重新记起它守护人间的使命。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/intro_4.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "eaedf39e25feec954942dcdbc3c1aea2795b710d11f5793c61d84b5d837789e1",
      "character_count": 149,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 36.3,
      "sources": [
        "res://data/chapters.json#/chapters/4/summary"
      ]
    },
    "clear_12": {
      "id": "clear_12",
      "kind": "stage_clear",
      "title": "潮痕下的石阶",
      "chapter_index": 4,
      "chapter_id": "ruins",
      "stage_index": 12,
      "level_index": 0,
      "level_id": "ruins-01",
      "text": "三道外层封锁解除，星图长廊入口点亮。",
      "path": "res://assets/audio_v13/voice/clear_12.mp3",
      "text_sha256": "12a82a5e93ebec09049e25a1fe047e64f0928d6daef782056e92913038d9fedf",
      "character_count": 18,
      "estimated_duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "sources": [
